{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>יך</b> — struck us." "<b>ויחבשנו</b> — like ולא חבשו, for a wound needs to be sprinkled and bandaged and softened afterward with oil." "<b>And the word טרף comes</b> as a past-tense verb alongside יך, which is future, by way of the standing tense, as I explained in my books."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:19.764698026Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}